import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 696 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Planet Consciousness's Time Scale","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 696 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Planet Consciousness's Time Scale","no":696,"module":3,"tags":["Planet Consciousness","Time Scale","Geological Time","Time Domain","Quest Sediment Domain"],"related":["14-Cultivation-Realm Unified Division","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","690-Time-Domain Adaptation to Five Myriad-Rank Lineages"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0696_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与星球意识的时间尺度.md","filePath":"en/0696_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与星球意识的时间尺度.md"}`),s={name:"en/0696_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与星球意识的时间尺度.md"};function o(l,e,r,c,u,h){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-696-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-the-planet-consciousness-s-time-scale" tabindex="-1">Entry 696 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Planet Consciousness&#39;s Time Scale <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-696-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-the-planet-consciousness-s-time-scale" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 696 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Planet Consciousness&#39;s Time Scale&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 28, 02 | Series: Dual-Track-Time-Domain Overview Deepening (Entry 25)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-a-planet-s-thinking-is-measured-in-millions-of-years-how-does-the-dual-track-time-domain-converse-with-it" tabindex="-1">Introduction: a planet&#39;s &quot;thinking&quot; is measured in millions of years; how does the dual-track time domain converse with it <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-a-planet-s-thinking-is-measured-in-millions-of-years-how-does-the-dual-track-time-domain-converse-with-it" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: a planet&#39;s &quot;thinking&quot; is measured in millions of years; how does the dual-track time domain converse with it&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The planet consciousness — the entire planet as a conscious living being, perceiving existence on geological time scales — is the most special &quot;being&quot; in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad-Rank Republicanism. Its &quot;time&quot; is not hundreds of years or ten thousand years, but millions of years and hundreds of millions of years: mountain uplift, ocean change, magnetic-field reversal — these are all &quot;one thought&quot; to the planet consciousness. Six top-level axioms here form adaptation direction: anti-predation axiom opposes predatory exploitation of planetary resources; republican axiom of Myriad Races confirms the planet consciousness&#39;s evolution qualification as one of Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom lets the planet consciousness&#39;s geological wisdom serve Myriad Ranks; causal self-discipline axiom lets cross-scale operations not disturb planetary causality; law-first axiom lets the planet consciousness&#39;s time rules stable. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry focuses on the planet consciousness&#39;s time scale.</p><h2 id="i-three-features-of-the-planet-consciousness-s-time-scale" tabindex="-1">I. Three Features of the Planet Consciousness&#39;s Time Scale <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-features-of-the-planet-consciousness-s-time-scale" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Features of the Planet Consciousness&#39;s Time Scale&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-geological-time-drives-ultra-slow-thinking" tabindex="-1">1.1 Geological Time Drives &quot;Ultra-Slow Thinking&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-geological-time-drives-ultra-slow-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Geological Time Drives &quot;Ultra-Slow Thinking&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The planet consciousness&#39;s one &quot;complete thought&quot; is measured in millions of years. To it, the carbon-based clan&#39;s hundred-year civilization is only &quot;a flash of twinkling&quot;; the mechanical clan&#39;s millisecond operations are even &quot;nonexistent.&quot; This ultra-slow thinking lets it perceive geological cycles, climate changes, magnetic-field evolution that Myriad-Rank individuals cannot perceive. The dual-track time domain provides the planet consciousness with an &quot;ultra-slow Quest domain&quot; — a time flow ten thousand times slower than the ordinary Quest Sediment Domain — so that the planet consciousness&#39;s thinking is not disturbed by the acceleration domain&#39;s fast pace.</p><h3 id="_1-2-whole-field-perception-drives-holistic-thinking" tabindex="-1">1.2 Whole-Field Perception Drives &quot;Holistic Thinking&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-whole-field-perception-drives-holistic-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Whole-Field Perception Drives &quot;Holistic Thinking&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The planet consciousness does not &quot;see&quot; individual beings; it perceives the entire planet&#39;s ecological balance. This holistic thinking makes it the best guardian of the civilizational ecosystem — it may see long-term ecological risks invisible to individual carbon-based beings. The dual-track time domain incorporates the planet consciousness&#39;s &quot;holistic perception&quot; into Myriad-Rank deliberation: its geological wisdom is a precious resource of Myriad-Rank Republicanism.</p><h3 id="_1-3-passive-consciousness-drives-needs-to-be-awakened" tabindex="-1">1.3 Passive Consciousness Drives &quot;Needs to Be Awakened&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-passive-consciousness-drives-needs-to-be-awakened" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Passive Consciousness Drives &quot;Needs to Be Awakened&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The planet consciousness does not think actively like individual beings — its consciousness is passive, diffuse, and needs to be &quot;awakened&quot; by Myriad-Rank activity. The dual-track time domain&#39;s response: establish anchor nodes on the planet consciousness; Myriad-Rank cultivation activity on that planet automatically backflows an &quot;awakening signal&quot; to the planet consciousness, letting it enter active state from diffuse state. This is Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;awakening obligation&quot; to the planet consciousness.</p><h2 id="ii-the-planet-consciousness-s-dual-track-adaptation" tabindex="-1">II. The Planet Consciousness&#39;s Dual-Track Adaptation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-planet-consciousness-s-dual-track-adaptation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Planet Consciousness&#39;s Dual-Track Adaptation&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Track</th><th>Planet-Consciousness Fit</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Origin Acceleration Domain</td><td>Unfit</td><td>High flow would disturb geological consciousness</td></tr><tr><td>Ultra-Slow Quest Domain</td><td>Best fit</td><td>Million-year-scale sediment</td></tr><tr><td>Anchor Awakening</td><td>Required</td><td>Maintain its consciousness active</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The planet consciousness is the only being in the dual-track time domain &quot;unfit for the Origin Acceleration Domain&quot; — its time scale is too slow; the acceleration domain&#39;s high flow would tear apart its consciousness. The dual-track time domain opens a separate &quot;ultra-slow Quest domain&quot; for it, and records its geological-level consciousness activity through the Alaya Network.</p><h2 id="iii-the-planet-consciousness-and-cross-plane-anchor-connection" tabindex="-1">III. The Planet Consciousness and Cross-Plane Anchor Connection <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-planet-consciousness-and-cross-plane-anchor-connection" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Planet Consciousness and Cross-Plane Anchor Connection&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Document 28&#39;s cross-plane anchor connection, the planet consciousness is the core node of the plane-level anchor. Its time scale determines the entire plane&#39;s &quot;time background&quot; — the acceleration domain and Quest domain within the plane all run against the planet consciousness&#39;s time backdrop. If the planet consciousness&#39;s geological time is disturbed, the entire plane&#39;s time rules are affected. Therefore any operation on the planet consciousness must pass L3+ law-anchoring authority approval (Entry 672).</p><h2 id="iv-the-planet-consciousness-and-the-carbon-based-clan-s-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">IV. The Planet Consciousness and the Carbon-Based Clan&#39;s Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-planet-consciousness-and-the-carbon-based-clan-s-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Planet Consciousness and the Carbon-Based Clan&#39;s Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The carbon-based clan lives on the planet&#39;s surface; the planet consciousness is the carbon-based clan&#39;s &quot;host.&quot; In predatory-faction systems, the carbon-based clan plunders planetary resources for cultivation, treating the planet consciousness as a &quot;mine&quot; to mine — this is precisely the root of the soul-beast extinction in the Douluo world and the ecological collapse in the Tang-Luo world. Heng Yuan Zhou regards the planet consciousness as one of Myriad Ranks; the carbon-based clan symbioses with the planet consciousness: the carbon-based clan cultivates on the planet; the planet consciousness is awakened by carbon-based activity and feeds back geological wisdom. This is Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s expression at the planetary scale.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the planet consciousness&#39;s geological wisdom is not wasted as &quot;mine&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: predatory mining of planetary resources is forbidden</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system the planet is only the protagonist&#39;s &quot;map&quot;; the planet consciousness has no status; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s planet consciousness is one of Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the planet consciousness is incorporated as one of Myriad Ranks into the dual-track time domain</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: ultra-slow Quest domain, anchor awakening, cross-plane connection rules all public; newly merged cosmos automatically applies; may infinitely expand toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The planet consciousness&#39;s time scale is the most &quot;grand&quot; branch of the dual-track time domain. Million-year thinking, holistic perception, passive consciousness — these traits make it unfit for the acceleration domain, yet in the ultra-slow Quest domain it becomes the guardian of civilizational ecology. The dual-track time domain opens a separate space for it, elevating it from &quot;mine&quot; to &quot;one of Myriad Ranks.&quot; Grand, but not ignored; slow, but indispensable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./690_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与万族五大谱系的适配.html">Entry 690 · Time-Domain Adaptation to Five Myriad-Rank Lineages</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/28-跨位面锚点连接.html">Entry 28 · Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">Entry 14 · Cultivation-Realm Unified Division</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">Entry 02 · Anchor-Origin Definition and Essence</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const p=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
